B.WS=new A.f(B.a55,["Salate","echilibrat",4,"https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/retete-de-salate/salata-mediteraneana-cu-pui-la-grill-reteta-simpla-si-gustoasa.html","Laura Lauren\u021biu","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/pui_salata.png",B.U5,"\u2022 400\u2013450 g piept pui f\u0103r\u0103 os \u0219i piele\n\u2022 40 ml ulei m\u0103sline; \xeenc\u0103 1 lingur\u0103 pentru grill\n\u2022 60 ml suc l\u0103m\xe2ie; \xeenc\u0103 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 pentru avocado\n\u2022 2 linguri ap\u0103\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 2 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 P\u0103trunjel, oregano, busuioc, piper\n\u2022 1 salat\u0103 iceberg\n\u2022 1 castravete\n\u2022 2 ro\u0219ii\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 ro\u0219ie\n\u2022 1\u20132 avocado\n\u2022 50 g m\u0103sline f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi","1. Amestec\u0103 40 ml ulei, 60 ml l\u0103m\xe2ie, apa, usturoiul \u0219i aromele. Rezerv\u0103 jum\u0103tate \xeentr-un bol curat. Marineaz\u0103 puiul \xeen rest 30 minute la frigider.\n2. Spal\u0103 \u0219i taie legumele. Strope\u0219te avocado cu linguri\u021ba de l\u0103m\xe2ie \u0219i pune totul \xeentr-un bol.\n3. Scurge puiul, unge cu lingura de ulei \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te pe grill \xeencins circa 6\u20137 minute pe parte. Verific\u0103 minimum 74\xb0C \xeen centru; odihne\u0219te 5\u20136 minute pe farfurie curat\u0103.\n4. Feliaz\u0103 puiul peste legume \u0219i adaug\u0103 numai dressingul curat rezervat. Serve\u0219te.","Verific\u0103 etichetele ingredientelor.",5,26,"Marinare 30 min + grill 12\u201314 min + odihn\u0103 5\u20136 min. Preg\u0103te\u0219te legumele \xeen timpul marin\u0103rii.","Legume \u0219i pui","Po\u021bi completa dup\u0103 foame cu p\xe2ine integral\u0103, preg\u0103tit\u0103 separat.","Marinarea se face la frigider. Culoarea ilustrat\u0103 nu dovede\u0219te g\u0103tirea; verific\u0103 temperatura cu un termometru.",u.V],t.R)
