B.X7=new A.f(B.a4K,["Fel Principal","echilibrat",6,"https://bucate-aromate.ro/2018/09/budinca-dietetica-cu-branza-si-conopida-la-cuptor/","Iuliana Sb\xeernea \xb7 Bucate Aromate","21.10.2026","RO","RO","assets/recipe_guides/conopida.png",B.Sq,"\u2022 500 g conopid\u0103\n\u2022 180 g br\xe2nz\u0103 vaci\n\u2022 200 g telemea mai slab\u0103\n\u2022 200 g iaurt pentru compozi\u021bie\n\u2022 4 ou\u0103 pentru compozi\u021bie\n\u2022 5 ro\u0219ii cherry pentru compozi\u021bie\n\u2022 M\u0103rar sau p\u0103trunjel, piper; sare dup\u0103 br\xe2nz\u0103\n\u2022 Pentru topping: 150 g iaurt, 1 ou, 3 ro\u0219ii cherry\n\u2022 H\xe2rtie de copt sau pu\u021bin unt pentru vas","1. Spal\u0103 conopida \u0219i desparte \xeen buche\u021bele. Fierbe 3\u20134 minute \xeen ap\u0103, scurge bine \u0219i las\u0103 s\u0103 se r\u0103coreasc\u0103.\n2. Amestec\u0103 br\xe2nzeturile, cele 4 ou\u0103, 200 g iaurt, verdea\u021ba \u0219i cele 5 ro\u0219ii tocate. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 conopida \u0219i pune \xeentr-un vas preg\u0103tit.\n3. Bate oul pentru topping cu 150 g iaurt. Toarn\u0103 peste compozi\u021bie \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 cele 3 ro\u0219ii feliate.\n4. Coace \xeen cuptor pre\xeenc\u0103lzit la 180\xb0C, 40\u201345 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeencheag\u0103 \u0219i se rumene\u0219te.",15,45,60,"Lapte, ou\u0103.",5,6,"Legume, ou\u0103 \u0219i lactate","Serve\u0219te cu salat\u0103. Telemeaua poate fi s\u0103rat\u0103: gust\u0103 \xeenainte de a ad\u0103uga sare."],t.R)
