B.a_u=new A.f(B.a4I,["Ciorbe / Supe","echilibrat",11,u.u,"NHLBI \xb7 NIH","21.10.2026","US","EN","assets/recipe_guides/supa_linte.png",B.TA,"\u2022 30 ml ulei m\u0103sline\n\u2022 2 morcovi medii\n\u2022 2 tije \u021belin\u0103 apio\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 mic\u0103\n\u2022 2 c\u0103\u021bei usturoi\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 oregano\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 busuioc\n\u2022 \xbd linguri\u021b\u0103 piper\n\u2022 Aprox. 384 g linte uscat\u0103\n\u2022 Aprox. 410 g ro\u0219ii zdrobite din conserv\u0103\n\u2022 480 ml sup\u0103 legume\n\u2022 1560 ml ap\u0103","1. Taie morcovii, \u021belina, ceapa \u0219i usturoiul. \xcenmoaie \xeen ulei \xeentr-o oal\u0103, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 ceapa devine fraged\u0103.\n2. Adaug\u0103 oregano, busuioc \u0219i piper. G\u0103te\u0219te \xeenc\u0103 2 minute.\n3. Pune lintea, ro\u0219iile, supa \u0219i apa. Adu la fierbere.\n4. Acoper\u0103 \u0219i fierbe domol cel pu\u021bin 60 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 lintea este moale. Verific\u0103 lichidul \u0219i amestec\u0103 periodic; serve\u0219te.",15,90,105,"\u021aelin\u0103; verific\u0103 supa de legume.",151,9,"Por\u021bia sursei: circa 240 ml. Linte: 2 c\u0103ni SUA \xd7 192 g/can\u0103, USDA linte crud\u0103. Conversiile sunt rotunjite.","Sup\u0103; por\u021bie mic\u0103","O por\u021bie mic\u0103 nu este neap\u0103rat o mas\u0103 complet\u0103. Po\u021bi asocia p\xe2ine integral\u0103 \u0219i salat\u0103; valorile afi\u0219ate se refer\u0103 numai la sup\u0103."],t.R)
