B.X2=new A.f(B.a4R,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava \u0219i ingredientele m\u0103surate. Folose\u0219te somon decongelat, dac\u0103 este congelat. \u021aine-l la rece p\xe2n\u0103 la preg\u0103tire.","Tav\u0103, bol, tel, lingur\u0103 \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Durata este orientativ\u0103. Verific\u0103 centrul por\u021biunii celei mai groase cu termometrul.",B.PI,"1. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul. Seteaz\u0103 cuptorul la aproximativ 205\xb0C \u0219i las\u0103-l s\u0103 ajung\u0103 la temperatur\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Indicatorul cuptorului arat\u0103 c\u0103 pre\xeenc\u0103lzirea s-a \xeencheiat.\n2. Amestec\u0103 sosul. Combin\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na, m\u0103rarul uscat, ceapa verde m\u0103run\u021bit\u0103, mu\u0219tarul \u0219i sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Sosul este omogen.\n3. Preg\u0103te\u0219te tava \u0219i pe\u0219tele. Pulverizeaz\u0103 tava cu spray \u0219i a\u0219az\u0103 por\u021biile cu pielea \xeen jos. Spal\u0103 m\xe2inile \u0219i ustensilele dup\u0103 contactul cu pe\u0219tele crud.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Por\u021biile sunt separate, f\u0103r\u0103 suprapunere.\n4. Asezoneaz\u0103 \u0219i acoper\u0103. Presar\u0103 usturoiul pudr\u0103 \u0219i piperul m\u0103surat, apoi distribuie sosul deasupra por\u021biilor.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Fiecare bucat\u0103 are sos la suprafa\u021b\u0103.\n5. Coace somonul. Pune tava \xeen cuptorul pre\xeenc\u0103lzit. Coace orientativ 20 de minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Pe\u0219tele devine opac \u0219i se desface \xeen fulgi.\n6. Verific\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. M\u0103soar\u0103 centrul buc\u0103\u021bii celei mai groase. Continu\u0103 g\u0103tirea dac\u0103 nu a atins minimum 63\xb0C; apoi serve\u0219te.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Termometrul confirm\u0103 minimum 63\xb0C, indiferent de aspect.",B.TR,B.U2,!0,"Pe\u0219tele trebuie s\u0103 ating\u0103 minimum 63\xb0C \xeen interior, m\u0103surat cu un termometru alimentar.","https://www.fsis.usda.gov/food-safety/safe-food-handling-and-preparation/food-safety-basics/safe-temperature-chart"],t.R)
B.a1A=new A.f(B.f,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te frunzele","Rupe frunzele sp\u0103late \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi u\u0219or de m\xe2ncat \u0219i usuc\u0103-le bine. Pune-le \xeentr-un bol \xeenc\u0103p\u0103tor.","Pe fundul bolului nu se adun\u0103 ap\u0103.","",0,B.c],t.M)
B.a24=new A.f(B.f,["Feliaz\u0103 m\u0103rul","Taie m\u0103rul, p\u0103str\xe2nd coaja. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 cotorul \u0219i semin\u021bele, apoi f\u0103 felii sub\u021biri.","Feliile au grosimi apropiate.","",0,B.c],t.M)
B.a2l=new A.f(B.f,["Adaug\u0103 l\u0103m\xe2ia","Strope\u0219te feliile cu sucul de l\u0103m\xe2ie m\u0103surat \u0219i \xeentoarce-le u\u0219or.","Suprafa\u021ba feliilor este umezit\u0103.","",1,B.c],t.M)
B.a1K=new A.f(B.f,["Combin\u0103 ingredientele","Pune peste frunze m\u0103rul, meri\u0219oarele, nucile tocate \u0219i miezul semin\u021belor de floarea-soarelui.","Ingredientele sunt distribuite \xeen bol.","",2,B.c],t.M)
B.a1X=new A.f(B.f,["Adaug\u0103 vinegreta","Toarn\u0103 vinegreta m\u0103surat\u0103 \u0219i \xeentoarce salata delicat, ridic\xe2nd frunzele de jos.","Frunzele au un strat sub\u021bire de sos.","",4,B.c],t.M)
B.a1Q=new A.f(B.f,["\xcemparte \u0219i serve\u0219te","Distribuie salata \xeen cele 6 por\u021bii ale re\u021betei, \xeemp\u0103r\u021bind \u0219i nucile, semin\u021bele \u0219i m\u0103rul. Serve\u0219te imediat.","Por\u021biile con\u021bin toate ingredientele, nu doar frunze.","",5,B.c],t.M)
