B.WH=new A.f(B.cD,["echilibrat","Garnituri",4,0,10,76,3,B.NE,"\u2022 aprox. 35 g semin\u021be de pin\n\u2022 567g spanac frunze, sp\u0103lat\n\u2022 aprox. 100 g stafide aurii f\u0103r\u0103 s\xe2mburi, ne\xeendesate\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 nuc\u0219oar\u0103 m\u0103cinat\u0103\n\u2022 \u215b linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 Ap\u0103, ad\u0103ugat\u0103 c\xe2te 60 ml, dup\u0103 nevoie","1. Rumene\u0219te u\u0219or semin\u021bele de pin \xeentr-o tigaie antiaderent\u0103, amestec\xe2nd; scoate-le \xeenainte s\u0103 se ard\u0103.\n2. Adaug\u0103 \xeen tigaie 60 ml de ap\u0103 \u0219i spanacul \xeen tran\u0219e. Completeaz\u0103 apa dup\u0103 nevoie, c\xe2t s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie frunzele. Pune stafidele la ultima tran\u0219\u0103.\n3. Adaug\u0103 nuc\u0219oara \u0219i sarea. C\xe2nd spanacul este \xeenmuiat \u0219i stafidele calde, elimin\u0103 excesul de ap\u0103. Serve\u0219te \xeen 4 por\u021bii cu semin\u021bele de pin.","Cantitatea de spanac este masa frunzelor crude, nu a spanacului deja g\u0103tit.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baby-spinach-golden-raisins-and","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Semin\u021be de pin.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
B.TQ=s(["peste","lamaie","lapte batut","usturoi","pesmet","ulei"],t.s)
B.WI=new A.f(B.cD,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",6,10,25,183,30,B.TQ,"\u2022 907g file de pe\u0219te\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 60 ml lapte b\u0103tut f\u0103r\u0103 gr\u0103sime sau cu 1% gr\u0103sime\n\u2022 2 pic\u0103turi sos iute\n\u2022 1 linguri\u021b\u0103 usturoi tocat\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 piper alb\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 sare\n\u2022 \xbc linguri\u021b\u0103 ceap\u0103 pudr\u0103\n\u2022 aprox. 55 g pesmet uscat simplu\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei vegetal\n\u2022 1 l\u0103m\xe2ie pentru servire","1. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la aproximativ 245\xb0C. Strope\u0219te pe\u0219tele cu suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie \u0219i tamponeaz\u0103-l.\n2. Amestec\u0103 laptele b\u0103tut cu sosul iute \u0219i usturoiul. Separat combin\u0103 pesmetul cu piperul, sarea \u0219i ceapa.\n3. Trece pe\u0219tele prin lichid, apoi prin crust\u0103. A\u0219az\u0103-l \xeen tava uns\u0103 cu ulei.\n4. Coace pe raftul din mijloc 20 minute, f\u0103r\u0103 \xeentoarcere. Verific\u0103 g\u0103tirea \u0219i \xeemparte \xeen 6 por\u021bii; serve\u0219te cu l\u0103m\xe2ie.","Varianta cu pesmet este una dintre op\u021biunile din surs\u0103. Masa este o conversie orientativ\u0103.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baked-fish","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, lapte \u0219i gr\xe2u. Verific\u0103 eticheta pesmetului.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
