B.WK=new A.f(B.cD,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",6,10,20,196,27,B.Sb,"\u2022 aprox. 230 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 gr\u0103sime\n\u2022 2 linguri\u021be m\u0103rar uscat\n\u2022 3 linguri ceap\u0103 verde tocat\u0103\n\u2022 2 linguri mu\u0219tar Dijon\n\u2022 2 linguri suc de l\u0103m\xe2ie\n\u2022 680g file de somon, \xeen 6 por\u021bii\n\u2022 \xbd linguri\u021b\u0103 usturoi pudr\u0103\n\u2022 \xbd linguri\u021b\u0103 piper negru\n\u2022 Spray pentru g\u0103tit","1. Pre\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te cuptorul la aproximativ 205\xb0C. Amestec\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na, m\u0103rarul, ceapa, mu\u0219tarul \u0219i l\u0103m\xe2ia.\n2. Pulverizeaz\u0103 tava cu spray. A\u0219az\u0103 somonul cu pielea \xeen jos; presar\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i piperul, apoi distribuie sosul.\n3. Coace aproximativ 20 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 este opac \u0219i se desface u\u0219or. Sursa cere minimum 63\xb0C \xeen interior. Serve\u0219te imediat.","O sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 cu alt procent de gr\u0103sime modific\u0103 valorile nutri\u021bionale.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/baked-salmon-dijon","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Pe\u0219te, lapte, mu\u0219tar.","",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
B.Nx=s(["fasole roz","plantain","rosii","ardei","ceapa","usturoi"],t.s)
B.WF=new A.f(B.cD,["echilibrat","Fel Principal",16,10,60,133,6,B.Nx,"\u2022 454g fasole roz uscat\u0103\n\u2022 2 banane plantain, tocate fin\n\u2022 1 ro\u0219ie mare tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1 ardei ro\u0219u mic tocat\n\u2022 1 ceap\u0103 alb\u0103 medie tocat\u0103\n\u2022 1\xbd linguri usturoi tocat\n\u2022 1\xbd linguri\u021be sare\n\u2022 2,4 litri ap\u0103 pentru \xeenmuiere; ap\u0103 suplimentar\u0103 la fierbere","1. Alege \u0219i spal\u0103 fasolea. Acoper-o cu cei 2,4 litri de ap\u0103 \u0219i las-o peste noapte \xeen frigider.\n2. Scurge \u0219i pune ap\u0103 proasp\u0103t\u0103 c\xe2t s\u0103 dep\u0103\u0219easc\u0103 fasolea cu aproximativ 2,5cm. Fierbe cu capacul \xeentredeschis aproximativ 1 or\u0103, p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeenmoaie; completeaz\u0103 apa c\xe2nd este nevoie.\n3. Adaug\u0103 plantainul, ro\u0219ia, ardeiul, ceapa, usturoiul \u0219i sarea. Continu\u0103 fierberea la foc mic p\xe2n\u0103 c\xe2nd plantainul este moale.","Folose\u0219te plantain, nu banane obi\u0219nuite de desert. Sursa \xeemparte preparatul \xeen 16 por\u021bii mici.","https://www.nhlbi.nih.gov/health/heart-healthy-living/healthy-foods/healthy-eating-recipes/caribbean-pink-beans","NHLBI / NIH","19.10.2026","Verific\u0103 etichetele ingredientelor.","\xcenmuiere peste noapte la frigider",!0,"20.10.2026"],t.R)
