B.Xb=new A.f(B.a4B,["clasic","Aperitive / Gust\u0103ri","e-Retete","https://www.e-retete.ro/retete/crema-de-branza-cu-marar","RO","RO","20.10.2026",B.Rh,"\u2022 500 g br\xe2nz\u0103 de vaci\n\u2022 \xbd ceap\u0103 mare\n\u2022 M\u0103rar proasp\u0103t, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 3\u20134 linguri maionez\u0103 gata preparat\u0103\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Op\u021bional pentru servire: ardei sau ro\u0219ii","1. Amestec\u0103 br\xe2nza cu maioneza \u0219i asezoneaz\u0103 treptat cu sare \u0219i piper, p\xe2n\u0103 se formeaz\u0103 o past\u0103.\n2. Toac\u0103 foarte fin ceapa sau d\u0103-o pe r\u0103z\u0103toare; m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te m\u0103rarul \u0219i \xeencorporeaz\u0103-le.\n3. Serve\u0219te crema simpl\u0103 sau \xeen jum\u0103t\u0103\u021bi de ardei ori ro\u0219ii.","Folose\u0219te maionez\u0103 gata preparat\u0103 pentru varianta f\u0103r\u0103 g\u0103tire. Por\u021biile \u0219i timpul total nu sunt precizate de surs\u0103.","Lapte; maioneza poate con\u021bine ou \u0219i mu\u0219tar. Verific\u0103 eticheta.",!0,0,!0,"Maionez\u0103 gata preparat\u0103.",B.TB],t.R)
