B.ZZ=new A.f(B.jE,["Acest traseu este pentru burt\u0103 deja cur\u0103\u021bat\u0103 \u0219i prefiart\u0103; cite\u0219te eticheta. Nu aplica aceia\u0219i timpi unei bur\u021bi crude. M\u0103soar\u0103 apa; oasele \u0219i spuma vor fi \xeendep\u0103rtate \xeenainte s\u0103 adaugi burta.","Oal\u0103 de minimum 7 litri, spumier\u0103, sit\u0103 deas\u0103, tigaie, r\u0103z\u0103toare, bol mare, tel \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Prefiert nu \xeenseamn\u0103 neap\u0103rat fraged sau gata de consum: timpul final depinde de produs. Uleiul colorat cu morcov schimb\u0103 aspectul, iar o\u021betul se ajusteaz\u0103 abia dup\u0103 dregere.",B.RI,B.Qm,"24.10.2026","Dup\u0103 ad\u0103ugarea g\u0103lbenu\u0219urilor, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C. Burta prefiart\u0103 se preg\u0103te\u0219te \u0219i conform etichetei.",u.V,B.R2,"\u2022 4 L ap\u0103 pentru baza de oase, plus ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru evaporare","1. Porne\u0219te baza din oase. Pune oasele, ceapa cur\u0103\u021bat\u0103 \u0219i apa rece m\u0103surat\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare \u0219i boabe de piper. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te la foc mediu.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Oasele sunt acoperite cu lichid.\n2. Spumeaz\u0103 \u0219i fierbe baza. Adun\u0103 spuma, redu focul \u0219i men\u021bine clocote mici aproximativ 2 ore. Dac\u0103 scade mult lichidul, completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ai o sup\u0103 aromat\u0103, cu fierbere lini\u0219tit\u0103.\n3. Strecoar\u0103 atent. Scoate oasele \u0219i ceapa. Treci lichidul printr-o sit\u0103 deas\u0103 \xeen alt\u0103 oal\u0103, ca s\u0103 re\u021bii boabele de piper \u0219i fragmentele de os.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Zeama nu con\u021bine resturi tari.\n4. Preg\u0103te\u0219te burta. Decongeleaz\u0103 burta \xeen frigider, dac\u0103 este congelat\u0103, \u0219i urmeaz\u0103 indica\u021biile etichetei. Taie fidelu\u021b\u0103, dac\u0103 nu este deja t\u0103iat\u0103. Toac\u0103 gogo\u0219arul separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: F\xe2\u0219iile au grosimi apropiate.\n5. G\u0103te\u0219te burta \xeen sup\u0103. Pune burta \u0219i gogo\u0219arul \xeen supa fierbinte. Fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 40 de minute, respect\xe2nd \u0219i eticheta. Verific\u0103 textura \u0219i continu\u0103 dac\u0103 produsul \xeenc\u0103 este tare.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Burta este fraged\u0103; nu te bazezi doar pe expirarea celor 40 de minute.\n6. Coloreaz\u0103 uleiul cu morcov. Rade morcovul fin. G\u0103te\u0219te-l \xeen uleiul m\u0103surat, la foc mediu-mic, amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 uleiul cap\u0103t\u0103 culoare portocalie. Strecoar\u0103 uleiul \xeen sup\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Uleiul este colorat, iar morcovul nu este ars.\n7. Omogenizeaz\u0103 dresul. Amestec\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile cu sm\xe2nt\xe2na \xeen bol. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul pisat fin.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Amestecul este uniform, f\u0103r\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219 \xeentreg.\n8. Tempereaz\u0103 cu zeam\u0103 fierbinte. Ia oala de pe foc. Toarn\u0103 \xeen bol c\xe2te pu\u021bin\u0103 sup\u0103 fierbinte, amestec\xe2nd continuu. Adaug\u0103 treptat mai multe polonice, p\xe2n\u0103 bolul con\u021bine un amestec bine \xeenc\u0103lzit.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Dresul este diluat \u0219i nu are fulgi coagula\u021bi.\n9. G\u0103te\u0219te oul controlat. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 dresul \xeen oal\u0103. Re\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te pe foc mic, amestec\xe2nd, p\xe2n\u0103 lichidul omogenizat atinge minimum 72\xb0C. Opre\u0219te focul \xeenainte de clocot puternic.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Temperatura este confirmat\u0103 cu termometrul, iar ciorba r\u0103m\xe2ne omogen\u0103.\n10. Potrive\u0219te acreala \u0219i serve\u0219te. Pune o parte din o\u021bet \u0219i gust\u0103 o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103. Completeaz\u0103 treptat sarea \u0219i acreala; gogo\u0219arul a adus deja o\u021bet. Nu e obligatoriu s\u0103 folose\u0219ti tot o\u021betul m\u0103surat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Gustul final nu este excesiv de acru sau s\u0103rat.",B.PH,B.Ur,!0,"supe_4_4"],t.R)
