B.Zy=new A.f(B.yr,["Spal\u0103 \u0219i cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 toate legumele. Taie cartofii \u0219i r\u0103d\u0103cinoasele \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi apropiate, dovlecelul separat. Aceasta este o variant\u0103 de legume din colec\u021bia aplica\u021biei, f\u0103r\u0103 dres de ou sau sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103.","Oal\u0103 de minimum 6 litri, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit, lingur\u0103 \u0219i cr\u0103ticioar\u0103 pentru bor\u0219.","Pune legumele dup\u0103 c\xe2t de repede se g\u0103tesc. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile \u0219i bor\u0219ul dup\u0103 ce cartofii sunt fragezi. La final gust\u0103 \u0219i ajusteaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i acreala.",B.Su,B.Qp,"24.10.2026",B.UF,"\u2022 2,5 L ap\u0103, plus pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 pentru \xeen\u0103bu\u0219ire\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i piper, dup\u0103 gust","1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te legumele \xeen grupe. Toac\u0103 ceapa fin, morcovul \u0219i ardeiul cubule\u021be. Taie cartofii \xeen cuburi, fasolea verde \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi, conopida \xeen buche\u021bele mici \u0219i dovlecelul separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Buc\u0103\u021bile se pot lua u\u0219or cu lingura.\n2. \xcenmoaie baza aromat\u0103. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mediu-mic. Pune ceapa, morcovul \u0219i ardeiul, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103, \u0219i amestec\u0103 aproximativ 5 minute. Nu le rumeni puternic.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este moale \u0219i u\u0219or translucid\u0103.\n3. Adaug\u0103 lichidul \u0219i legumele mai ferme. Toarn\u0103 apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103. Pune cartofii \u0219i fasolea verde. Adu la fierbere bl\xe2nd\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 15 minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Legumele au \xeenceput s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 se destrame.\n4. Adaug\u0103 conopida, dovlecelul \u0219i maz\u0103rea. Pune buche\u021belele mici de conopid\u0103, dovlecelul \u0219i maz\u0103rea. Continu\u0103 orientativ 10 minute \u0219i verific\u0103 toate legumele. Fasolea proasp\u0103t\u0103 poate avea nevoie de mai mult timp dec\xe2t cea congelat\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Cartofii se str\u0103pung u\u0219or, iar fasolea, conopida \u0219i maz\u0103rea sunt g\u0103tite.\n5. Pune ro\u0219iile. Adaug\u0103 ro\u0219iile din conserv\u0103 m\u0103run\u021bite \u0219i amestec\u0103 delicat. Las\u0103 s\u0103 revin\u0103 la fierbere bl\xe2nd\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ro\u0219iile sunt distribuite \xeen zeam\u0103, iar cartofii erau deja fragezi.\n6. Acre\u0219te dup\u0103 gust. D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat. Adaug\u0103-l treptat \xeen ciorb\u0103, gust\xe2nd o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103. Las\u0103 un clocot final u\u0219or.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Acreala nu acoper\u0103 gustul legumelor.\n7. Pune verdea\u021ba \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea. Opre\u0219te focul, adaug\u0103 leu\u0219teanul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat \u0219i completeaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i piperul numai dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Legumele sunt g\u0103tite \u0219i \xee\u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 forma.",B.UB,B.P8,!0,"supe_4_4"],t.R)
