B.Zv=new A.f(B.hw,["Aceast\u0103 variant\u0103 con\u021bine ou\u0103 \u0219i sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103: este f\u0103r\u0103 carne, dar nu de post. Folose\u0219te pleurotus din comer\u021b, cur\u0103\u021bate, \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 lactatele \u0219i g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile la rece p\xe2n\u0103 preg\u0103te\u0219ti dresul.","Oal\u0103, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit, furculi\u021b\u0103, bol \xeenc\u0103p\u0103tor, tel \u0219i termometru alimentar.","Taie sau rupe ciupercile \xeen f\xe2\u0219ii de grosime apropiat\u0103. Textura seam\u0103n\u0103 cu cea a bur\u021bii, dar este un preparat diferit. Usturoiul \u0219i o\u021betul se potrivesc dup\u0103 gust.",B.OJ,B.Qn,"24.10.2026","\u2022 500 g ciuperci pleurotus\n\u2022 300 g sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 fermentat\u0103, minimum 20% gr\u0103sime\n\u2022 3 g\u0103lbenu\u0219uri\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 1 c\u0103p\u0103\u021b\xe2n\u0103 usturoi, dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 1 morcov, 1 gogo\u0219ar \xeen o\u021bet\n\u2022 2 linguri ulei\n\u2022 2,5 L ap\u0103, plus ap\u0103 fierbinte pentru evaporare\n\u2022 Sare, piper \u0219i o\u021bet, dup\u0103 gust",B.OS,"Dup\u0103 dregerea cu g\u0103lbenu\u0219uri, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C. Aceast\u0103 variant\u0103 are ou \u0219i lapte.",u.V,"Sursele prezint\u0103 variante diferite: articolul Laura Lauren\u021biu este de post, iar varianta aplica\u021biei p\u0103streaz\u0103 oul \u0219i sm\xe2nt\xe2na. Referin\u021bele sunt pentru tehnic\u0103, nu pentru transferul gramajelor.","1. Preg\u0103te\u0219te ciupercile. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 baza tare \u0219i eventualele impurit\u0103\u021bi. Dac\u0103 le cl\u0103te\u0219ti, scurge-le bine. Rupe sau taie p\u0103l\u0103riile \u0219i tulpinile fragede \xeen f\xe2\u0219ii lungi; elimin\u0103 por\u021biunile foarte lemnoase.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: F\xe2\u0219iile au grosimi apropiate \u0219i nu sunt lemnoase.\n2. Preg\u0103te\u0219te legumele \u0219i aromele. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 morcovul \u0219i taie-l \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi mari. Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 usturoiul \u0219i m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te gogo\u0219arul; p\u0103streaz\u0103-le separat pentru etapele urm\u0103toare.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ai legumele preg\u0103tite \xeenainte de fierbere.\n3. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te baza. Pune uleiul \u0219i morcovul \xeen oal\u0103, pe foc mediu-mic. \xcentoarce morcovul \xeen ulei, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103-l arzi, apoi adaug\u0103 apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Morcovul este \xeen lichid fierbinte, f\u0103r\u0103 por\u021biuni arse.\n4. Fierbe ciupercile. Pune f\xe2\u0219iile de pleurotus \u0219i pu\u021bin\u0103 sare. Fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 20 de minute, apoi verific\u0103 morcovul \u0219i o f\xe2\u0219ie de ciuperc\u0103; continu\u0103 dac\u0103 sunt tari.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ciupercile sunt g\u0103tite, iar morcovul se str\u0103punge u\u0219or.\n5. \xcencorporeaz\u0103 morcovul \u0219i gogo\u0219arul. Scoate morcovul, zdrobe\u0219te-l fin cu furculi\u021ba \u0219i pune-l \xeenapoi. Adaug\u0103 gogo\u0219arul m\u0103run\u021bit \u0219i las\u0103 s\u0103 se \xeenc\u0103lzeasc\u0103 \xeen sup\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Morcovul este dispersat, iar gogo\u0219arul este distribuit \xeen zeam\u0103.\n6. Preg\u0103te\u0219te dresul. Omogenizeaz\u0103 sm\xe2nt\xe2na cu g\u0103lbenu\u0219urile. Adaug\u0103 usturoiul pisat, \xeencep\xe2nd cu o parte din cantitate dac\u0103 preferi un gust mai discret.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Amestecul este uniform, f\u0103r\u0103 g\u0103lbenu\u0219 \xeentreg.\n7. Tempereaz\u0103 treptat. Ia oala de pe foc. Adaug\u0103 \xeen bol sup\u0103 fierbinte \xeen tran\u0219e mici, amestec\xe2nd cu telul. Continu\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 amestecul este bine \xeenc\u0103lzit, apoi toarn\u0103-l \xeen oal\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Dresul se \xeencorporeaz\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 fulgi coagula\u021bi.\n8. G\u0103te\u0219te oul controlat. Re\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te la foc mic, amestec\xe2nd, p\xe2n\u0103 lichidul omogenizat atinge minimum 72\xb0C. Opre\u0219te focul f\u0103r\u0103 clocot puternic.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Temperatura este confirmat\u0103, iar ciorba r\u0103m\xe2ne omogen\u0103.\n9. Potrive\u0219te gustul. Pune o\u021bet treptat \u0219i gust\u0103 o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103. Completeaz\u0103 sarea, piperul \u0219i usturoiul dup\u0103 preferin\u021b\u0103; gogo\u0219arul a adus deja acreal\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Gustul este echilibrat, f\u0103r\u0103 acreal\u0103 excesiv\u0103.",B.T8,B.U7,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
B.a21=new A.f(B.f,["Verific\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 pe\u0219tele","Treci degetele peste file \u0219i \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 oasele g\u0103site cu penseta. Toac\u0103 pe\u0219tele \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103-l la rece p\xe2n\u0103 \xeel amesteci cu restul ingredientelor.","Carnea tocat\u0103 nu are oase detectabile.","",-1,B.c],t.M)
B.a0M=new A.f(B.f,["G\u0103te\u0219te orezul separat","Cl\u0103te\u0219te orezul m\u0103surat \u0219i fierbe-l \xeen ap\u0103 dup\u0103 indica\u021biile ambalajului, p\xe2n\u0103 se p\u0103trunde. Scurge-l \u0219i r\u0103core\u0219te-l \xeenainte s\u0103-l pui peste pe\u0219te.","Boabele sunt g\u0103tite \u0219i scurse, nu fierbin\u021bi.","",-1,B.c],t.M)
B.a2q=new A.f(B.f,["Amestec\u0103 \u0219i formeaz\u0103 peri\u0219oarele","Combin\u0103 pe\u0219tele, orezul r\u0103corit, oul \u0219i pesmetul, cu pu\u021bin\u0103 sare \u0219i piper. Cu m\xe2inile umede formeaz\u0103 bile mici de aproximativ 2\u20133 cm.","Compozi\u021bia este legat\u0103, iar bilele au m\u0103rimi apropiate.","",0,B.c],t.M)
B.a3k=new A.f(B.f,["Preg\u0103te\u0219te baza de legume","Pune ceapa, morcovul \u0219i ardeiul tocate \xeen apa m\u0103surat\u0103. Fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 15 minute \u0219i verific\u0103 s\u0103 \xeenceap\u0103 s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie.","Legumele nu mai sunt crude \u0219i tari.","",1,B.b7],t.M)
B.a0q=new A.f(B.f,["Pune peri\u0219oarele \xeen zeam\u0103","Redu focul \u0219i las\u0103 bilele s\u0103 alunece pe r\xe2nd \xeen lichid. Nu amesteca energic; p\u0103streaz\u0103 clocote mici.","Peri\u0219oarele r\u0103m\xe2n \xeentregi.","",2,B.c],t.M)
B.a3d=new A.f(B.f,["Verific\u0103 centrul","G\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 15 minute \u0219i verific\u0103 o peri\u0219oar\u0103 mare: centrul trebuie s\u0103 fie g\u0103tit \u0219i s\u0103 ating\u0103 minimum 72\xb0C, fiind un amestec cu ou. Continu\u0103 dac\u0103 este nevoie.","Pe\u0219tele nu mai este translucid, iar temperatura confirm\u0103 g\u0103tirea.","",2,B.b7],t.M)
B.a3h=new A.f(B.f,["Adaug\u0103 bor\u0219 dup\u0103 gust","D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat, apoi toarn\u0103-l treptat \xeen ciorb\u0103. Gust\u0103 zeama \u0219i las\u0103 \xeenc\u0103 aproximativ 2 minute la foc mic.","Acreala este pe gustul t\u0103u, iar peri\u0219oarele sunt \xeentregi.","",3,B.bS],t.M)
B.a1m=new A.f(B.f,["\xcencheie cu leu\u0219tean","Opre\u0219te focul, pune leu\u0219teanul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat \u0219i completeaz\u0103 sarea \u0219i piperul numai dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti.","Peri\u0219oarele sunt complet g\u0103tite \u0219i nu con\u021bin oase.","",4,B.c],t.M)
