B.Zu=new A.f(B.hw,["Traseul principal este f\u0103r\u0103 ou \u0219i sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103, ca \xeen imagini. Dac\u0103 alegi dresul op\u021bional, urmeaz\u0103 \u0219i cei doi pa\u0219i dedica\u021bi lui. Spal\u0103 bine frunzele, fiindc\u0103 pot re\u021bine nisip \xeentre pliuri.","Oal\u0103, boluri pentru sp\u0103lat, sit\u0103, cu\u021bit, tel \u0219i termometru alimentar dac\u0103 folose\u0219ti ou.","Loboda se pune dup\u0103 ce orezul este aproape gata. G\u0103te\u0219te frunzele p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeenmoaie, f\u0103r\u0103 fierbere inutil\u0103, \u0219i pune leu\u0219teanul la final pentru arom\u0103 proasp\u0103t\u0103.",B.OK,B.Qy,"24.10.2026","\u2022 4\u20135 leg\u0103turi mari de lobod\u0103\n\u2022 1 fir de ceap\u0103 verde, 1 morcov\n\u2022 2 linguri orez\n\u2022 1 lingur\u0103 ulei pentru \xeen\u0103bu\u0219ire\n\u2022 2 L ap\u0103, plus pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 pentru \xeen\u0103bu\u0219ire\n\u2022 P\xe2n\u0103 la 500 ml bor\u0219, ad\u0103ugat dup\u0103 gust\n\u2022 Op\u021bional, pentru un singur dres: 200 ml sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103 \u0219i 2 ou\u0103, folosite \xeempreun\u0103\n\u2022 Sare \u0219i leu\u0219tean, dup\u0103 gust",B.PS,"Dac\u0103 alegi dresul cu ou, \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te amestec\xe2nd p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C. Varianta de baz\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 ou \u0219i sm\xe2nt\xe2n\u0103, este cea ilustrat\u0103.",u.V,"Uleiul, omis din lista veche, este m\u0103surat acum. Op\u021biunea cu ou este explicat\u0103 separat \u0219i se g\u0103te\u0219te dup\u0103 temperare; nu se toarn\u0103 ou crud dup\u0103 oprirea definitiv\u0103 a focului.","1. Alege \u0219i spal\u0103 frunzele. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 frunzele deteriorate \u0219i tulpinile foarte tari. Spal\u0103 loboda \xeen mai multe ape, ridic\xe2nd frunzele din ap\u0103, ca nisipul s\u0103 r\u0103m\xe2n\u0103 pe fund. Scurge \u0219i taie f\xe2\u0219ii mari.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Nu mai exist\u0103 nisip sau impurit\u0103\u021bi pe frunze.\n2. Preg\u0103te\u0219te legumele. Taie ceapa verde fin \u0219i rade sau toac\u0103 m\u0103runt morcovul. Cl\u0103te\u0219te orezul \u0219i p\u0103streaz\u0103 bor\u0219ul separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ingredientele sunt gata \xeenainte s\u0103 porne\u0219ti focul.\n3. \xcenmoaie baza. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mediu-mic. Pune ceapa \u0219i morcovul cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 \u0219i amestec\u0103 p\xe2n\u0103 se \xeenmoaie, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 le arzi.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este moale \u0219i u\u0219or translucid\u0103.\n4. Fierbe orezul. Adaug\u0103 apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103 \u0219i orezul. Fierbe bl\xe2nd orientativ 15 minute, apoi verific\u0103 bobul; continu\u0103 dac\u0103 este \xeenc\u0103 tare.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Orezul este aproape g\u0103tit \xeenainte de ad\u0103ugarea frunzelor.\n5. Pune loboda. Adaug\u0103 frunzele \u0219i amestec\u0103 u\u0219or. G\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 5 minute, p\xe2n\u0103 frunzele se \xeenmoaie.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Loboda este g\u0103tit\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 tulpini tari.\n6. Adaug\u0103 bor\u0219. D\u0103 bor\u0219ul \xeen clocot separat \u0219i pune-l treptat, gust\xe2nd. Las\u0103 un clocot final u\u0219or.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Zeama are acreala dorit\u0103.\n7. Preg\u0103te\u0219te dresul numai dac\u0103 \xeel alegi. Pentru varianta simpl\u0103, treci direct la pasul de servire. Pentru varianta dreas\u0103, omogenizeaz\u0103 cele dou\u0103 ou\u0103 cu sm\xe2nt\xe2na \xeentr-un bol.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ai ales varianta simpl\u0103 sau un dres omogen.\n8. Tempereaz\u0103 \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te dresul op\u021bional. Numai pentru varianta cu ou: ia oala de pe foc \u0219i \xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te dresul cu sup\u0103 fierbinte ad\u0103ugat\u0103 treptat, amestec\xe2nd. Toarn\u0103 \xeen oal\u0103 \u0219i re\xeenc\u0103lze\u0219te pe foc mic p\xe2n\u0103 la minimum 72\xb0C, f\u0103r\u0103 clocot puternic.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Oul este g\u0103tit la temperatura verificat\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 fulgi coagula\u021bi.\n9. Gust\u0103 \u0219i serve\u0219te. Opre\u0219te focul, pune leu\u0219teanul sp\u0103lat \u0219i tocat \u0219i potrive\u0219te sarea dup\u0103 ce gu\u0219ti o lingur\u0103 r\u0103corit\u0103.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Loboda este g\u0103tit\u0103, iar acreala \u0219i sarea sunt echilibrate.",B.TT,B.Og,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
B.a3t=new A.f(B.f,["Cl\u0103te\u0219te lintea","Alege lintea, \xeendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 impurit\u0103\u021bile \u0219i cl\u0103te\u0219te-o \xeentr-o sit\u0103 fin\u0103. Las-o s\u0103 se scurg\u0103.","Nu mai exist\u0103 impurit\u0103\u021bi vizibile, iar lintea este scurs\u0103.","",0,B.c],t.M)
B.a20=new A.f(B.f,["Taie legumele","Cur\u0103\u021b\u0103 \u0219i toac\u0103 ceapa, morcovul \u0219i cartoful \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi mici, apropiate ca m\u0103rime.","Cartoful nu are buc\u0103\u021bi mult mai mari dec\xe2t restul.","",-1,B.c],t.M)
B.a2U=new A.f(B.f,["\xcenmoaie legumele","\xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mediu-mic, adaug\u0103 legumele \u0219i amestec\u0103 orientativ 5 minute. Dac\u0103 se prind, redu focul \u0219i pune pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103.","Ceapa \xeencepe s\u0103 se \xeenmoaie \u0219i nu este ars\u0103.","",1,B.b6],t.M)
B.a1V=new A.f(B.f,["Fierbe lintea","Pune lintea \u0219i apa fierbinte m\u0103surat\u0103. Dup\u0103 revenirea la fierbere, redu focul \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te orientativ 25 de minute, amestec\xe2nd periodic pe fundul oalei.","Lintea se desface, iar cartoful \u0219i morcovul sunt moi.","",2,B.eT],t.M)
B.a0j=new A.f(B.f,["Paseaz\u0103 cu grij\u0103","Opre\u0219te focul \u0219i folose\u0219te blenderul vertical cu capul scufundat, pornind lent. Respect\u0103 instruc\u021biunile aparatului pentru lichide fierbin\u021bi.","Supa este fin\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 buc\u0103\u021bi tari.","Nu \xeenchide lichid fierbinte \xeentr-un blender etan\u0219 neadecvat.",3,B.c],t.M)
B.a36=new A.f(B.f,["Potrive\u0219te consisten\u021ba \u0219i condimentele","Adaug\u0103 pu\u021bin chimion \u0219i ment\u0103 din cantitatea preg\u0103tit\u0103, sare \u0219i piper. Dac\u0103 supa este prea dens\u0103, dilueaz\u0103 cu pu\u021bin\u0103 ap\u0103 fierbinte \u0219i omogenizeaz\u0103. Gust\u0103 \xeenainte s\u0103 pui mai multe mirodenii.","Supa curge din polonic, iar condimentele nu domin\u0103.","",4,B.c],t.M)
B.a2f=new A.f(B.f,["Serve\u0219te cu l\u0103m\xe2ie la alegere","Pune supa \xeen boluri \u0219i ofer\u0103 l\u0103m\xe2ia separat, ca fiecare s\u0103 \xee\u0219i potriveasc\u0103 acreala.","Supa are textura \u0219i intensitatea aromelor dorite.","",5,B.c],t.M)
B.T_=s([B.a3t,B.a20,B.a2U,B.a1V,B.a0j,B.a36,B.a2f],t.J)
B.a3U=new A.f(B.ak,["Linte ro\u0219ie \u0219i chimion \xb7 Laura Lauren\u021biu","https://www.lauralaurentiu.ro/retete-culinare/supe-ciorbe/supa-de-linte-rosie.html"],t.l)
