B.a3z=new A.f(B.a4J,["Folose\u0219te linte uscat\u0103 pentru boabe. M\u0103soar\u0103 ingredientele \u0219i verific\u0103 eticheta supei de legume.","Oal\u0103 \xeenc\u0103p\u0103toare, sit\u0103, toc\u0103tor, cu\u021bit \u0219i lingur\u0103.","P\u0103streaz\u0103 fierberea bl\xe2nd\u0103 \u0219i verific\u0103 lichidul: lintea continu\u0103 s\u0103 absoarb\u0103 ap\u0103.",B.QN,B.Qq,"24.10.2026",B.V_,"1. Cl\u0103te\u0219te lintea. \xcendep\u0103rteaz\u0103 impurit\u0103\u021bile, cl\u0103te\u0219te lintea \u0219i scurge-o.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Nu r\u0103m\xe2n impurit\u0103\u021bi vizibile.\n2. Taie legumele. Toac\u0103 ceapa, morcovii \u0219i apio \xeen buc\u0103\u021bi mici; m\u0103run\u021be\u0219te usturoiul separat.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Buc\u0103\u021bile au dimensiuni apropiate.\n3. \xcenmoaie baza. \xcenc\u0103lze\u0219te uleiul la foc mediu \u0219i g\u0103te\u0219te ceapa, morcovul \u0219i apio, amestec\xe2nd.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ceapa este fraged\u0103, f\u0103r\u0103 por\u021biuni arse.\n4. Adaug\u0103 aromele. Pune usturoiul, oregano, busuiocul \u0219i piperul. Amestec\u0103 aproximativ 2 minute.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Aromele sunt distribuite \u0219i usturoiul nu s-a ars.\n5. Pune lintea \u0219i lichidele. Adaug\u0103 lintea, ro\u0219iile, supa de legume \u0219i apa m\u0103surate. Adu la fierbere.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Ingredientele sunt \xeen lichid fierbinte.\n6. Fierbe p\xe2n\u0103 lintea este fraged\u0103. Redu focul, acoper\u0103 \u0219i fierbe cel pu\u021bin 60 de minute. Amestec\u0103 periodic \u0219i completeaz\u0103 cu ap\u0103 fierbinte dac\u0103 este necesar.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Boabele sunt moi; continu\u0103 dac\u0103 r\u0103m\xe2n tari.\n7. Gust\u0103 \u0219i por\u021bioneaz\u0103. Verific\u0103 gustul \xeenainte de a ad\u0103uga sare: supa de legume poate fi s\u0103rat\u0103. Por\u021bia sursei este aproximativ 240 ml.\nContinu\u0103 c\xe2nd: Lintea este complet g\u0103tit\u0103.",B.Pm,B.RU,!0,"supe_4_5"],t.R)
